License: Apache License 2.0

This copy keeps the course geometry, painted ground texture, and barrel mesh.
The barrel diffuse and specular images are from osrf/gazebo_models
(construction_barrel, Apache-2.0); Hosei's world referenced them but did
not ship the image files.
Gazebo Classic material scripts were replaced with Fortress colors and a PBR
albedo map so `ign gazebo` can load the world. The model is included from
gazebo/worlds/igvc_course.sdf at the same pose the Orange launch used
(0 16.3 0).
